II. METHOD
We performed DFT calculations by using the VASP code16–18 in generalized gradient approximations (GGAs) with PW91 functionals19 and Projector Augmented Waves (PAW) pseudopotentials.20 The Brillouin zone was sampled using a single k point at the point, which is a reasonable choice given the large size of the chosen supercell. The Si-rich 3 × 3 reconstruction exhibits dangling bonds (DBs) located on the top of pyramidal Si structures separated by about 9.3  ̊A from each other.21,22 The periodic slab contains
