ogendoped (density 3 × 1018 cm−3) n-type 6H-SiC(0001) singlecrystal wafer was used. After outgassing, the SiC sample was flashed at 1100 ◦C to remove the native oxide, followed by silicon deposition on the surface at 650 ◦C for a few minutes,26 giving a well-reconstructed 3 × 3 surface.14 The N ,N ′-bis(1-hexylheptyl)perylene-3,4:9,10bis(dicarboximide) DHH-PTCDI was synthesized by reac
